      ", so the figures can't be changed. Ask the manager or administrator to reopen it."
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="banner ok" style="font-weight:500">"Completed on time."</div>
  " "
  <div class="deptband wholesale" role="heading" aria-level="2">
    <div>
      <div class="big">"Wholesale cash up"</div>
      <div class="small">"Wednesday, 28 October 2026"</div>
    </div>
    <div class="small">
      "You are filling in the "
      <b>"Wholesale"</b>
      " sheet"
